  "purpose": "Break the prairie farm road into a short native low-bank descent and two yellow-grass uphill gates. A permanent cottonwood windbreak closes side bypasses; the existing seed grower and flower plot give the landing a real destination. Preserve both rivers, both bridges, the original hayfield ledge, all NPCs/rewards, four-grass eastern neck and the Former Shores branch.",
